== List of Pets ==
There are currently {{Green|87}} pets available on the main server ({{Green|86}} on non-{{gamemode|Bingo}} profiles), each granting a variety of different benefits and advantages. <!--Newest pet included in the count is the Eagle Pet from 0.27.2-->

'''Some important notes:'''
* {{Red|'''Important:'''}} Pet stats are increased every level, but the number displayed in the tooltip is always rounded '''down'''. This means that, if a pet gives +3.75 {{Stat|cd}}, the number displayed in the tooltip will be <code>3</code>. On the other hand, the [[Profiles|SkyBlock Profile]] will display numbers rounded properly.
* Having a specific collection is required only to ''craft'' the pet. Players can use every pet without any restrictions.

