== Pet Items ==
{{Main|Pet Items}}
* '''[[Pet Items]]''' are items that can boost the benefits given by pets. 
* Each pet can hold only {{green|one}} Pet Item at a time.
* Pet Items can be applied by right-clicking them onto an active, physically summoned pet (not from the Pets Menu). 
* Pet Items are free to apply but cost {{Coins}} to be retrieved. This can be done:
**Using a {{Item|Super Scrubber}}, without applying a new Pet Item.
**Using any Pet Item to replace the currently equipped one.
* {{NPCSprite|Zog}} sells various '''Pet Items''' in exchange for {{Coins}}, most of which can be upgraded with a {{Item|Zog Anvil}}. Other Pet Items can be obtained from the [[Mythological Ritual]], event rewards, or mob drops.

