== Pet Leveling ==
=== Normal Pets ===
==== Skill Experience ====
* Summoned pets can be leveled up to {{Level|100}}, with the exception of the {{Item|Golden Dragon Pet}}, {{Item|Jade Dragon Pet}}, and {{Item|Rose Dragon Pet}}, which can go to {{Level|200}}. 
* Pets gain experience from the players gaining {{cyan|Skill Experience}} with the pet equipped, with the following exceptions:
**The {{Item|Wisp Pet}}, which is leveled up through feeding it [[File:Crude Gabagool.png|21px|link=y]][[File:Very Crude Gabagool.png|21px|link=y]][[File:Heavy Gabagool.png|21px|link=]][[File:Hypergolic Gabagool.png|21px|link=]][[Gabagool (disambiguation)|Gabagool]];
**The {{Skill|Carpentry}}, {{Skill|Taming}}, {{Skill|Dungeoneering}}, {{Skill|Runecrafting}} and {{Skill|Social}} skills do not give pet experience. 
