**{{aqua|'''Additively'''}}: {{stat|Wisdom}} is a type of [[Stats|stat]] that increases the [[Skills|Skill]] {{cyan|XP}} the player gains for a specific [[Skills|Skill]].
**{{aqua|'''Multiplicatively'''}}: these are compatible with [[File:Crude Gabagool.png|21px|link=y]][[File:Very Crude Gabagool.png|21px|link=y]][[File:Heavy Gabagool.png|21px|link=]][[File:Hypergolic Gabagool.png|21px|link=]][[Gabagool (disambiguation)|Gabagool]]. Pets can also gain experience with [[Pets#Exp Sharing|Exp Sharing]].
