=== Upgrading Rarity ===
{{Main|Kat}}

There are {{green|3}} ways to increase a Pet's rarity: {{NPCSprite|Kat}}, the {{Item|Tier Boost}} Pet Item, and Pet-specific conditions.

*{{NPCSprite|Kat}} resides at the front of the {{Zone|Pet Care}}. Given a Pet and varying amounts of {{c}} time and items, she will upgrade its rarity by {{green|1}} tier:
**The {{c}} cost can be decreased: for each Pet Level, an additive discount of {{green|0.3%}} is applied, up to {{green|30%}} at {{Level|100}}. 
**The time cost can be decreased by the following:<br>{{grey|(A)}} offering her {{Item|Kat Flower}}s ({{green|-1 day}} per) or {{Item|Kat Bouquet}}s ({{green|-5 days}} per), both purchased from the [[Bits Shop]] for {{Bits|500}} or {{Bits|2500}} respectively;<br>{{grey|(B)}} using an {{Item|Enchanted Clock}} ({{Green|-1 hour}} with a cooldown of {{Green|48 hours}}).<br>{{grey|(C)}} syphoning the {{Item|Kiwi Shard}} ({{Attr|Kat's Favorite}})
**The upgraded pet will have its level adjusted based on its XP. For example, a {{Level|86}} {{Rare}} pet with {{green|4.6 million}} cumulative will be adjusted to {{Level|81}} when it is upgraded to {{Epic}}.
**Some Pets cannot be upgraded this way: {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}}, {{Item|Montezuma Pet}}, {{Item|Rift Ferret Pet}}, {{Item|Kuudra Pet}}, {{Item|Wisp Pet}} and {{Item|Bingo Pet}}.
* Using a {{Item|Tier Boost}} Pet Item will boost the rarity of a pet by {{green|1}} tier (similar to a {{Item|Recombobulator 3000}}) until the [[Pet Items|Pet Item]] held by the Pet is changed. 
* Some Pet-specific conditions exist:
***The {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}} is upgraded <u>exclusively</u> {{ConfirmationNeeded}} through {{cyan|Bestiary Milestones}};
***The {{Item|Kuudra Pet}} is upgraded through {{Item|Kuudra Chunk}}s;
***The {{Item|Bingo Pet}} is upgraded through {{Gamemode|Bingo}} ranks;
***The {{Item|Wisp Pet}} is upgraded <u>exclusively</u> through {{Item|Wisp Upgrade Stone}}s;
***The {{Item|Montezuma Pet}} is upgraded <u>exclusively</u> through finding {{Item|Enigma Soul}}s.

