== Trivia ==
* If the player's inventory is full and a slain mob drops a pet, the pet will drop on the ground instead of going into the stash.
* [[Changelog/2020/May 5|Patch 0.7.8]] was released on May 6, 2020, and contained multiple references and resemblances to ''Pokémon''.
** [[Pet Items]] resembled the ability to hold items in ''Pokémon''. The [[Carrot Candy|Carrot Candies]] resemble Rare Candies and simulate the same effect of giving XP to the Pokémon in the Pokémon games.
** [[Kat]], one of the NPCs that got added in addition to the Pet update, has an appearance similar to that of Serena, the female protagonist from ''Pokémon X and Y''.
* Four achievements can be earned related to pets.
** Getting a pet to level 80 will award the "{{ach|Caretaker}}" achievement.
** The "{{ach|Friend for Life}}" achievement is an extended version of the "Caretaker" achievement that is awarded upon taking a pet to level 100.
***This can also be earned by purchasing a level 100 pet from an auction or obtaining a level 100 pet through a trade.
** Having 20 unique pets awards "{{ach|The Real Zoo Shady}}" achievement.
** Getting at least 100 {{Blue|Pet Score}} awards "{{ach|King Of The Pets}}" achievement.
